<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκθῡμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spirited, ardent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλων ὑπηρεσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			,cf. <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.38
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				<i>ardently,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Oen.
					15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>JTr.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			; <i>vehemently, bravely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρμησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.67.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.17.9
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωνίζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.54
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
